---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description={SITE.tagline}>
  <div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head"><h1>About</h1></header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I'm an applied AI engineer. I build voice and agent systems, measure how they behave, and turn what I learn into tools and guides other developers can use.</p>
    <p>At SalesAi, I designed and led the move from a white-label voice platform to an agent harness we own: Whisper, Gemini and ElevenLabs, with Twilio SIP on GCP. I also built evaluation and fine-tuning tooling for our agents and integrated NVIDIA's Parakeet speech recognition and Magpie speech synthesis models into Google Cloud L4 GPU deployments. I lead the AI Center of Practice and work directly on customer solutions as a solution architect. This company work is described here, not published as open source.</p>
    <p>My independent work is public. I published a <a href="/projects/five-lane-router">five-lane request router</a> with its model, dataset, evaluation and a <a href="https://huggingface.co/blog/ericmey/train-your-own-request-router">tutorial for training your own</a>. <a href="/projects/musubi">Musubi</a> gives agents persistent memory, hybrid retrieval and a lifecycle for curating captures. A <a href="/projects/musubi-ecosystem">shared runtime and host integrations</a> bring that memory into coding agents.</p>
    <p>Before this, I led product engineering at SalesAi and engineering teams at Salesforce, where I managed the integration of Einstein AI into internal tools. I'm based in {SITE.location}. Outside work: guitar, sound design and custom music hardware. <a href={`mailto:${SITE.links.email}`}>Email me</a> or find me on <a href={SITE.links.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</Base>
